g6 3. Nf3 Bg7 4. g3 O-O 5. Bg2 d6 6. O-O Nbd7 7. Nc3 e5 8. Qc2 c6 9. Rd1 Qe7
10. dxe5 dxe5 11. Be3 Nc5 12. Qd2 Nh5 13. Bh6 f5 14. h3 Ne6 15. Bxg7 Nexg7 16.
b3 e4 {and this is the position given in BCM. The game continued:} 17. Ne1 f4
